dil sayyed e abraar ka qabu me kaha'n hai <br>
nazro'n me dhuwa'n hai - andher jaha'n hai <br>
is haal pe shabbir ke haste hai sitamgaar<br>
<br>
bazu kate, sar shaq hai, lagi pusht pa shamsheer <br>
hai ankh me bhi teer -- bechain hai'n shabbir <br>
sar taaba qadam sher huwa khoon mesarshaar<br>
<br>
sar ghazi ka hai shaah ke zanu pe qayamat <br>
hai waqte shahadat - karte hain wasiyyat <br>
lasha mera khaime me na lejaiye sarkaar<br>
<br>
abbas tere dam se tha ghar shaah ka abaad <br>
ab ho gaya barbaad -- dil hota hai nashaad <br>
khaimou pe nazar aati hai taaraji ke asaar<br>
<br>
har ek ko himmat thi bharosa tha tumhara <br>
hai kaun hamara -- tumhi the sahaara <br>
ab zainab o kulsoom ka allah madadgaar<br>
<br>
shehzadiyo'n pa hogi ab har gaam pa bedaad <br>
pad jayegi uftaad -- fariyaad hai fariyaad <br>
kis tarha jiye bibiyaa'n jeena huwa dushwaar<br>
<br>
lipta ke sakina ko bahot rote hain sarwar <br>
aur kehte hai roker -- ab aayega mehshar <br>
hojayenge neele meri bachi tere rukhsaar<br>
<br>
shabbir hai har ghar me alamdaar ka matam <br>
har ankh hai purnam - manzar hai ye alam <br>
